🥉 EXP 09 — K-MEANS CLUSTERING
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Algorithm:
1. Load the Iris dataset and select the required features.
2. Choose 3 clusters and initialize their centroids.
3. Assign each data point to the nearest centroid.
4. Recalculate the centroids and repeat until the clusters stabilize.
5. Calculate the Silhouette Score and plot the resulting clusters.

Viva Keywords:
Iris → 3 Clusters → Centroid → Assignment → Silhouette Score


